1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,667
What is ASTRA?

2
00:00:03,217 --> 00:00:09,397
It's a digital accounting education hub that helps future CPAs grow beyond technical skills.

3
00:00:10,147 --> 00:00:14,334
Earn XP as you explore, and flip the cards to see what is inside.

4
00:00:14,684 --> 00:00:19,015
Warm up with quick games: balance the entry, and think like an accountant.

5
00:00:19,965 --> 00:00:22,552
Then beat the clock in Debit or Credit Rush!

6
00:00:22,902 --> 00:00:27,826
In the Habit Hub, crack the Bayanihan Bakeshop case to unlock habits and rank up.

7
00:00:28,876 --> 00:00:32,771
Side quests test your competencies, ten activities at a time.

8
00:00:33,121 --> 00:00:38,429
Students get tutorials, spreadsheet exercises, videos, and templates in one place.

9
00:00:38,779 --> 00:00:42,847
Educators build a teaching plan from seven suggested approaches,

10
00:00:43,197 --> 00:00:47,687
and PLV admins track six policies on a live readiness roadmap.

11
00:00:48,537 --> 00:00:51,613
Collect badges, pick your soundtrack, and make it yours.

12
00:00:51,963 --> 00:00:56,022
ASTRA. Build beyond your technical skills. Start your quest today!

